rota lap 4657, row 2 -- Fire, the row that sees; read the threshold page, standfast, reds-first and the three depths. Its instruction to read the ledger before reading anything new is what put the cold roster ahead of the design work, and its instruction to look at what refuses is what turned a rune census from a curiosity into a binding.
